## Trap notes (this session's scars)

- **esbuild bundles BUILT dist, not src**: edit adapter-mcp src → `npx tsc -b` in that package → `pnpm run bundle` in packages/agentide → restart gateway. Stale dist cost ~1h twice.
- Kill gateways/apps by PID from `ss -ltnp` (pkill -f 'bin.bundled' doesn't match); app processes can linger zombie-ish after EADDRINUSE crashes — sim now fail-fasts on :3000 busy.
- App reads `.env` relative to ITS cwd — boot from the example dir.
- Tokens expire 1h; app .env token too (bounce app after re-mint).
- `agentide` on PATH = global PUBLISHED binary (0.9.3, no fixes). The local bundle = `node agentide/packages/agentide/dist/bin.bundled.cjs`.
- `git push` may ask for credentials: `gh auth setup-git` + `GIT_ASKPASS=echo git push` (multi-account keyring quirk).
- Adapters stay STATELESS (CONTEXT.md lock) — any future push/notify feature must grill around it (mcp-tools-refresh chose the version-stamp route).

